msgid ""
"This argument requires xlwings ``PRO``. Path to a PDF file on which the "
"report will be printed. This is ideal for headers and footers as well as "
"borderless printing of graphics/artwork. The PDF file either needs to have "
"only 1 page (every report page uses the same layout) or otherwise needs the "
"same amount of pages as the report (each report page is printed on the "
"respective page in the layout PDF)."
